  unitName: Thunder God
  unitId: 40204
  unitNumber: 265
  description: This subspecies of Metal God is said to hold within its massive body
    an enormous collection of information on the known world. For some reason they
    enjoy exhibiting the knowledge they hold inside, though since they speak regardless
    of whether or not someone wants to listen they are generally considered a nuisance.
    When they do occasionally notice someone subtly taking interest in them they
    quickly become silent, however they are just as quick to resume the conversation.
  summonDesc: Why the metal record species<br>exists is still a great mystery...<br>Ah,
    but I know much about it!
